{"cover":{"src":"audio/elijah/cover.m4a","text":"Elijah and the Fire.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":2.575,"words":[{"w":"Elijah","s":0.65,"e":1.025},{"w":"and","s":1.025,"e":1.137},{"w":"the","s":1.137,"e":1.238},{"w":"Fire","s":1.238,"e":1.975}]},"ravens-title":{"src":"audio/elijah/ravens-title.m4a","text":"Part One. Bread from the Ravens.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.425,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.85},{"w":"One","s":0.85,"e":1.3},{"w":"Bread","s":1.438,"e":1.75},{"w":"from","s":1.75,"e":1.887},{"w":"the","s":1.887,"e":1.975},{"w":"Ravens","s":1.975,"e":2.825}]},"ravens-0":{"src":"audio/elijah/ravens-0.m4a","text":"Long ago, a king named Ahab and his people stopped loving God. They prayed to a pretend god called Baal instead.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8.85,"words":[{"w":"Long","s":0.65,"e":0.875},{"w":"ago","s":0.875,"e":1.3},{"w":"a","s":1.4,"e":1.512},{"w":"king","s":1.512,"e":1.85},{"w":"named","s":1.85,"e":2.138},{"w":"Ahab","s":2.138,"e":2.812},{"w":"and","s":2.812,"e":2.938},{"w":"his","s":2.938,"e":3.1},{"w":"people","s":3.1,"e":3.45},{"w":"stopped","s":3.45,"e":3.8},{"w":"loving","s":3.8,"e":4.15},{"w":"God","s":4.15,"e":4.95},{"w":"They","s":5.112,"e":5.3},{"w":"prayed","s":5.3,"e":5.575},{"w":"to","s":5.575,"e":5.662},{"w":"a","s":5.662,"e":5.725},{"w":"pretend","s":5.725,"e":6.237},{"w":"god","s":6.237,"e":6.65},{"w":"called","s":6.65,"e":6.963},{"w":"Baal","s":6.963,"e":7.4},{"w":"instead","s":7.4,"e":8.275}]},"ravens-1":{"src":"audio/elijah/ravens-1.m4a","text":"So God’s prophet Elijah told the king, “Because of this, no rain will fall, not one drop, until I say so!”","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":8.325,"words":[{"w":"So","s":0.625,"e":0.812},{"w":"God's","s":0.812,"e":1.2},{"w":"prophet","s":1.2,"e":1.625},{"w":"Elijah","s":1.625,"e":2.025},{"w":"told","s":2.025,"e":2.288},{"w":"the","s":2.288,"e":2.375},{"w":"king","s":2.375,"e":3.075},{"w":"Because","s":3.25,"e":3.562},{"w":"of","s":3.562,"e":3.65},{"w":"this","s":3.65,"e":4.1},{"w":"no","s":4.213,"e":4.475},{"w":"rain","s":4.475,"e":4.8},{"w":"will","s":4.8,"e":4.987},{"w":"fall","s":4.987,"e":5.475},{"w":"not","s":5.55,"e":5.75},{"w":"one","s":5.75,"e":5.975},{"w":"drop","s":5.975,"e":6.375},{"w":"until","s":6.412,"e":6.688},{"w":"I","s":6.688,"e":6.838},{"w":"say","s":6.838,"e":7.112},{"w":"so","s":7.112,"e":7.725}]},"ravens-2":{"src":"audio/elijah/ravens-2.m4a","text":"Then God sent Elijah to hide by a little stream. And every morning and every evening, big black ravens flew down and brought him bread and meat!","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":9.8,"words":[{"w":"Then","s":0.6,"e":0.812},{"w":"God","s":0.812,"e":1.288},{"w":"sent","s":1.288,"e":1.5},{"w":"Elijah","s":1.5,"e":1.9},{"w":"to","s":1.9,"e":2.025},{"w":"hide","s":2.025,"e":2.4},{"w":"by","s":2.4,"e":2.575},{"w":"a","s":2.575,"e":2.638},{"w":"little","s":2.638,"e":2.862},{"w":"stream","s":2.862,"e":3.8},{"w":"And","s":3.925,"e":4.075},{"w":"every","s":4.075,"e":4.375},{"w":"morning","s":4.375,"e":4.787},{"w":"and","s":4.787,"e":4.9},{"w":"every","s":4.9,"e":5.2},{"w":"evening","s":5.2,"e":5.875},{"w":"big","s":6.013,"e":6.25},{"w":"black","s":6.25,"e":6.575},{"w":"ravens","s":6.575,"e":7.062},{"w":"flew","s":7.062,"e":7.3},{"w":"down","s":7.3,"e":7.662},{"w":"and","s":7.662,"e":7.775},{"w":"brought","s":7.775,"e":7.987},{"w":"him","s":7.987,"e":8.162},{"w":"bread","s":8.162,"e":8.488},{"w":"and","s":8.488,"e":8.6},{"w":"meat","s":8.6,"e":9.225}]},"widow-title":{"src":"audio/elijah/widow-title.m4a","text":"Part Two. The Jar That Never Ran Out.","voice":"af_heart,af_bella","duration":3.7,"words":[{"w":"Part","s":0.6,"e":0.887},{"w":"Two","s":0.887,"e":1.35},{"w":"The","s":1.5,"e":1.625},{"w":"Jar","s":1.625,"e":1.887},{"w":"That","s":1.887,"e":2.025},{"w":"Never","s":2.025,"e":2.3},{"w":"Ran","s":2.3,"e":2.55},{"w":"Out","s":2.55,"e":3.125}]},"widow-0":{"src":"audio/elijah/widow-0.m4a","text":"After a while the stream dried up. So God sent